;; forms lens (PLAN-005) — turns whose PROGRAM calls a given tool.
;;
;; Mirrors SpellAgent.Hist.Query.forms({:tool_call, name}): returns the nodes
;; (seq-ordered, as projected maps) whose form AST contains a (tool/<name> ...)
;; call anywhere. Pure transform over the injected `data/nodes` projection;
;; `data/tool` is the tool name to match.
;;
;; A node's "form_tools" is the pre-extracted list of tool-call names in its AST
;; (Elixir cannot pass the raw AST into the sandbox, so the names are surfaced).
(->> data/nodes
     (filter (fn [n] (contains? (get n "form_tools") data/tool))))
